  "instance_name": "mapping_001",
  "label": "The wife's disapproving look is mapped onto the textual description of her reaction",
  "description": "The text 'and your wife gives you this look' explicitly identifies the visual entity (the woman) as the 'wife' who is giving a disapproving look. The visual material (the woman's expression) is directly mapped onto the textual description of her role and action, creating an analogical mapping where the visual entity embodies the textual entity. This mapping is reinforced by the spatial positioning of the text below the woman's face, directly linking her expression to the described 'look'.",
